t-family: 'times new roman', times;\">Download Dongzhan Shipping\u00a0 Profile<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<div class=\"host-lopnbnfpjmgpbppclhclehhgafnifija\" style=\"position: relative; z-index: 2147483647;\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-w68fbc52d4c6b9-0-2\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell panel-grid-cell-empty\" ><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-w68fbc52d4c69b-0-1\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-w68fbc52d4c69b-0-1-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child\" data-index=\"2\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<h4><strong><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Strategics Position Of Terminals &amp; Global partnership\u00a0<\/span><\/strong><\/h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: helvetica;\">Gosford Storage and Logistics Ltd. is among the best around the world in the provision of tank farm tank storage, vessel ship, pipeline and truck tankers. Shiploads of fuel and other major cargo can be delivered with our vessel's, pipeline network and truck tankers to numerous locations and as well stored in our tank farm, tank storage facilities. We have been crucially known to have available ready storage tanks, vessel ships, quality trucks services and good pipeline connections layout in Jurong Ireland port, Rotterdam Netherland port, Houston Texas USA port, Terminal  UK port, Fujairah UAE port, and many other major ports across the world, with our quality and premium storage tanks, vessel ships, trucking and pipeline distribution supplies services scattered in surplus manners all over the world with an affordable range for a customer profitable margin and available to suits customers interest for inflow and outflow of oil and gas products all over the world. We have more than enough to offer, Gosford Storage and Logistics Ltd. is massive and can accommodate customers for more than one transaction at a time. We are a Irelandan originated company that has huge leverage to render good quality tank storage, ships, trucks and pipeline services to any port worldwide.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-40-3\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-has-style\"  style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\" ><div class=\"siteorigin-panels-stretch panel-row-style panel-row-style-for-40-3\" style=\"padding: 3% 0% 0% 0%;\" data-stretch-type=\"full\" ><div id=\"pgc-40-3-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-40-3-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child\" data-index=\"3\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>Located in Ireland, Gosford Storage and Logistics Ltd. is one of the largest independent petroleum tank farm tank storage and shipping companies in Asia Pacific originated in Jurong Port.<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\">We are also one of the biggest commercial storage facilities worldwide, as we operate in a huge strategic position that puts us in a leading position whereby petroleum, oil and gas fuel storage, distribution and supplies have kept on continuously growing in the port of Jurong Ireland and many other major ports across the world. With our experience and good storage and shipping mechanism within Jurong commercial sea ports of operations, Our organization has found our balance to leverage our business as per expanding our outpost in the provision and operations of tank farm tank storage, transloading, pipeline networking, trucking and shipping supplies across the world.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-40-3-1\"  c